    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d190-a1">

                <pb facs="0377" n="249" sameAs="frus:frus1885/pg249"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Payan to Mr. Becerra</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenaventura</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-04-07"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 7,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Panama power rebels. Government forces will be sent to recover Isthmus and
                    restore order.</p>
                <closer><signed>PAYAN.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
